      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "Fig. 1\n<dl><dd><i>Crassostrea gigas</i> infested with <i>Polydora websteri</i> collected from Blidselbucht at Sylt in the German Wadden Sea. a Inner surface of infested valves of <i>C. gigas</i> showing mud blisters caused by <i>P. websteri</i>; b close up of an opened mud blister inhabited by <i>P. websteri</i>; c overview of a single specimen of <i>P. websteri</i>; and d black lines on the sides of the palps of <i>P. websteri</i>.</dd></dl>",
